  title: Keep the scene and folder together
  prevReadme: {fileID: 0}
  nextReadme: {fileID: 0}
  sections:
  - name: 
    heading: Info
    text: 'Hello this is a readme for the team to understand and helps communication
      in the unity project. So to put it simply, you need to keep the unity scenes
      and their folder together in a folder because the folders are the lightmaps
      that are created when someone is generate lighting for the bake lights. Id
      they are separate , the bake lights won''t be funcitonnale and when you will
      regenerate the bake lightmap , it will generate another folder. '
